ion","/#","\n","^no but for real, thank you so much. ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^relief","/#","\n","^in times of trouble, i hope i'll manage to stay true to my heart. ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^and to stand for myself. ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^if i can't do that for me, who will? ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^question","/#","\n","^am i right? ;o) ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n","^at least you are bestie. ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^i'll give some more thought to the party program and i'll come back tomorrow to invite you all. ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^see ya best bestie! <3 ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^bye","/#","\n","^See you, Squilliam! Thanks for the talk!","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"prep":["^right... ","#","^score ","/#","#","^squill","/#","\n","^you're right ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^i hope that being pretty is enough for the people to come. ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^i'm trying to be my best self ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^and perhaps that will be enough ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^perhaps not ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^sad","/#","\n","^hahahhhaha right? ;o) ","#","^squill  ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n","^i guess that's how life goes after all ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^thank you for being a bestie by my side. ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^relief","/#","\n","^i'll give some more thought to the party program and i'll come back tomorrow to invite you all. ","#","^squill","/#","\n","^see ya bestie!! ","#","^squill ","/#","#","^bye","/#","\n","^Have a nice evening Squilliam!","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"Inky":[["#","^inky","/#","^... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Are you okay Inky? You seem... very focused...","\n","^I see things. So many things. All happening at once. Like in a perfect circle. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I see the moon hidden by purple clouds. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I see the sun as its own entity, pursuing an endless race against a clock ticking at every seconds that passes. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I see the essence of matter. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^angry","/#","\n","^I feel the purpose of solidity, the roughness of air, and the fresh crisp of leaves I'd be walking on if I had feet. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I see chaos as the one true thing reuniting us, for only the tumult can both hold and release what it takes for life to occur... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^answer","/#","\n","^For the world to be, and for all its beings to be at the same time. ","#","^inky","/#","\n",["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.56.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Okay, I'd say that's quite... intense.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.57.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Omg and is it... bad for us??",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.58.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-2","flg":18},{"s":["^Flour appears to be quite the delicacy around here...",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.56.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"intense"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.57.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"omen"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.c-2.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.58.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"sniffy"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"intense":["^Intensity and perplexity. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^All working hand in hand. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^A hand at the end of each arm, reaching in the air. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^surprise","/#","\n","^So many, many arms. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^alerted","/#","\n","^Like an octopus waving their tentacles... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^tired","/#","\n","^In The Void... the mighty Void!!! ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^angry","/#","\n",{"->":"inky2"},{"#f":1}],"omen":["^What is good and bad. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^There is square and round. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^There is one and many. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^There is silence and chaos. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^There is purple, red, blue, black. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^A mix of colors all resulting in darkness. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^And finally The Void... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^tired","/#","\n","^The mighty Void. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^angry","/#","\n",{"->":"inky2"},{"#f":1}],"sniffy":["^What is sniffing. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^What is smell. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^What is taste. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^What is outside that tries to reach within. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^What is in realms I can't perceive. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^All I do is hear it. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^The Void. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^angry","/#","\n",{"->":"inky2"},{"#f":1}],"inky2":[["^What is this Void you're mentioning?","\n","^It's nothing and everything at the same time. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Everythingness. And nowhereness. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^It's where I come from. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Ah, I'm rambling. I guess I'm a little homesick. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sad","/#","\n",["ev",{"^->":"inky2.0.25.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Homesickness is a feeling I can relate to.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"inky2.0.26.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^The Void sounds cool!",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"inky2.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.25.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"homesick"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"inky2.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.26.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"coolvoid"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"homesick":["^You can miss your home. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Or miss a place that felt like home. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Or even miss a place where you felt like a complete stranger. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^As long as there was life... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^tired","/#","\n","^There are emotions to be felt. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^And places to be missed. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sad","/#","\n","^I am happy we can relate on this subject, as beings from different worlds merging into one. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^happy","/#","\n","^Someday I hope to bring sweet treats from this world into mine. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Like maybe cinnamon rolls. Or cakes. Or cookies. The possibilities are as infinite as The Void itself. ","#","^inky  ","/#","#","^sassy","/#","\n","^Anyways. Tomorrow is your last day, right? ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^We will hold a special farewell meeting in the break room. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^The night grows dark... Time to go home. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I wish you a delightful evening. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^bye","/#","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"coolvoid":["^The Void is a very 'cool' place, indeed. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^It is lacking in the baked goods department, definitely. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^But maybe, someday, maybe... ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^sad","/#","\n","^I could bring some recipes back to my homevoid. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^That would be great. ","#","^inky  ","/#","#","^relief","/#","\n","^I hope I can realize that dream of mine. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Anyways. Tomorrow is your last day, right? ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^We will hold a special farewell session in the break room. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^The night grows dark... Time to go home. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I wish you a delightful evening. ","#","^inky ","/#","#","^bye","/#","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"ending":[["^As everyone leaves the shop for the evening, you notice some leftover treats behind the counter...","\n","^Should you leave treats for Yuzu the Delivery Dog to find tomorrow morning? Or throw them out?","\n","ev","str","^Leave Yuzu a treat.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Throw them out.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"treat"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"trash"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"trash":["^You throw them out. It's good to clean up.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"treat":["^You leave some for Yuzu. She will remember that! ","#","^treat","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}